            "answer": "<p>We accept various forms of payment which include the following. Apple<br\/>Pay, Visa, Visa Debit, Mastercard, PayPal, Shop Pay, Klarna, American Express & Google Pay.<\/p><p><\/p><p>For UK orders, we also accept Clearpay and DivideBuy, allowing you to pay in 4, 6, 9 & 12 instalments.<\/p><p><\/p><p>See all relevant payment info for your country <a href=\"\/pages\/payment\" title=\"Payment\">here.<\/a><\/p>"
